BT 1 0 0 1 0 82.4 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The Campus Festival Registration and Financial Audit produced the correct report for Test Case 9. The) Tj T* (duplicate registration R101 was detected and rejected, leaving 3 valid registrations and registration fees of) Tj T* (Rs. 1500. Adding the Rs. 5000 sponsorship gave a total income of Rs. 6500, and after subtracting the) Tj T* (expenses of Rs. 4000 the final balance was Rs. 2500, correctly classified as a Surplus. The program) Tj T* (demonstrates tuples with unpacking, list membership testing with ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (in) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, append\(\), a running total, arithmetic) Tj T* (operators and if / elif / else conditions. The Deficit and Break-even branches are covered by further test) Tj T* (cases.) Tj T* ET
